{"id": "adf4e289-bb01-4c32-ae72-c252922af3b1", "slug": "spatial-exploring-terminal", "title": "Spatial Exploring Terminal", "description": "Spatial Exploring Background Effect is designed for delivering a visual treatment or immersive background effect. Key features include atmospheric visuals, motion depth, and flexible presentation layering. It is suitable for visual-first pages, motion studies, and atmospheric hero treatments.", "content": "---\nversion: \"neuform-staff-featured-2026-05-22\"\nname: \"Spatial Exploring Terminal\"\ndescription: \"Spatial Exploring Background Effect is designed for delivering a visual treatment or immersive background effect. Key features include atmospheric visuals, motion depth, and flexible presentation layering. It is suitable for visual-first pages, motion studies, and atmospheric hero treatments.\"\ncolors:\n  primary: \"#38BDF8\"\n  secondary: \"#05070D\"\n  accent: \"#818CF8\"\n  background: \"#38BDF8\"\n  surface: \"#525866\"\n  text-primary: \"#FFFFFF\"\n  text-secondary: \"#A1A1AA\"\n  border: \"#525866\"\ntypography:\n  display-lg:\n    fontFamily: \"Rajdhani\"\n    fontSize: \"64px\"\n    fontWeight: 500\n    lineHeight: \"1.04\"\n    letterSpacing: \"0\"\n  body-md:\n    fontFamily: \"JetBrains Mono\"\n    fontSize: \"16px\"\n    fontWeight: 400\n    lineHeight: \"1.6\"\n  label-md:\n    fontFamily: \"JetBrains Mono\"\n    fontSize: \"12px\"\n    fontWeight: 600\n    lineHeight: \"1.2\"\nspacing:\n  base: \"8px\"\n  gap: \"16px\"\n  card-padding: \"24px\"\n  section-padding: \"80px\"\nrounded:\n  card: \"2px\"\n  control: \"1px\"\n  pill: \"9999px\"\ncomponents:\n  card:\n    background: \"Use the surface token with subtle borders and HTML-matched shadow depth\"\n    radius: \"Match the declared card radius token\"\n  button:\n    background: \"Use primary or accent colors for the main action\"\n    radius: \"Use the control or pill radius based on the source HTML\"\n---\n# Spatial Exploring Terminal\nSource: Neuform staff featured templates. Author: Samnang Aing (@samnang). Views: 115; favorites: 8; remixes: 2.\nTags: background, animated, webgl, threejs, dither, effect.\n## Overview\nSpatial Exploring Background Effect is designed for delivering a visual treatment or immersive background effect. Key features include atmospheric visuals, motion depth, and flexible presentation layering. It is suitable for visual-first pages, motion studies, and atmospheric hero treatments.\n\nArchival Terminal SYS.OP.VER // 4.0.2 Volumetric Lock Acquired Map the spatial void. Synthesize dimensional environments with uncompromising optical fidelity. Atmospheric rendering meets sub-pixel halftone precision to…\n## Composition\nUse the attached HTML reference as the source of truth. Preserve the visible hierarchy, first-screen composition, section rhythm, density, and interaction tone before adapting copy or content.\nKey visible headings include: Map the spatial void..\n## Colors\nAnchor the palette in primary #38BDF8, secondary #05070D, accent #818CF8, background #38BDF8, surface #525866, text-primary #FFFFFF. Keep background, surface, text, and border roles distinct so generated layouts retain the same contrast pattern as the source.\n## Typography\nUse Rajdhani for display moments and JetBrains Mono for body copy unless the HTML clearly demands a compatible fallback. Labels and technical metadata should use JetBrains Mono or an equivalent mono face.\n## Layout\nKeep spacing deliberate and stable. Favor the same grid direction, max-width behavior, card density, and responsive stacking seen in the HTML. Do not replace distinctive source structures with generic SaaS sections.\n## Components\nCards, buttons, badges, navigation, and repeated blocks should preserve the source geometry, border treatment, and hover feel.\n## Motion\nPreserve existing motion cues such as masked reveals, staggered entrance, hover lift, scroll-triggered transitions, and ambient movement. Keep easing smooth and restrained.\n## WebGL & Effects\n\nIf the source includes canvas, WebGL, Three.js, gradients, particles, or atmospheric effects, rebuild them as supporting layers behind the content. Keep effects performant, responsive, and secondary to the interface.\n\n## Guardrails\n- Do not flatten the source into a generic card grid.\n- Do not swap the color mode unless the source clearly supports it.\n- Preserve the first viewport signal, focal object, and visual density.\n- Keep buttons, cards, and badges aligned to the same radius and border language.", "preview_html": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"en\">\n<head>\n  <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n  <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n  <title>Spatial Exploring Terminal</title>\n\n  <script src=\"https://cdn.tailwindcss.com\"></script>\n  <script src=\"https://code.iconify.design/iconify-icon/1.0.7/iconify-icon.min.js\"></script>\n  <script src=\"https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/three.js/r128/three.min.js\"></script>\n  <script src=\"https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/gsap/3.12.2/gsap.min.js\"></script>\n  <script src=\"https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/gsap/3.12.2/ScrollTrigger.min.js\"></script>\n\n  <link href=\"https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Rajdhani:wght@400;500;600;700&family=JetBrains+Mono:wght@400;500;600&display=swap\" rel=\"stylesheet\">\n</head>\n\n<body\n  class=\"antialiased w-full min-h-screen m-0 overflow-x-hidden text-[#F5F7FF] selection:bg-[#38BDF8]/30\"\n  style=\"\n    font-family: 'Rajdhani', sans-serif;\n    background-color: #04060B;\n    --accent: #38BDF8;\n    --accent-soft: #BAE6FD;\n    --accent-deep: #0EA5E9;\n    --accent-dark: #075985;\n    --violet: #818CF8;\n    --text: #F5F7FF;\n    --muted: #9CA3AF;\n    --dim: #525866;\n    --panel: #05070D;\n  \">\n\n  <!-- Subtle 0.5px Dot-Grid Pattern Layer -->\n  <div\n    class=\"fixed inset-0 pointer-events-none z-0\"\n    style=\"background-image: radial-gradient(circle, rgba(255,255,255,0.055) 0.5px, transparent 0.5px); background-size: 6px 6px;\">\n  </div>\n\n  <!-- Pointer-Parallax Container for Background Map -->\n  <div\n    id=\"dot-parallax\"\n    class=\"fixed inset-0 pointer-events-none z-0 opacity-35\"\n    style=\"background-image: radial-gradient(circle, rgba(56,189,248,0.09) 1px, transparent 1px); background-size: 40px 40px; background-position: center;\">\n  </div>\n\n  <!-- WebGL Laser System Mount -->\n  <div id=\"laser-mount\" class=\"fixed inset-0 w-full h-full z-0 pointer-events-none\"></div>\n\n  <!-- Top Navigation / Metadata Header -->\n  <header class=\"absolute top-0 w-full px-6 lg:px-10 py-8 flex justify-between items-center z-50 pointer-events-none\">\n    <div\n      class=\"flex items-center gap-3 text-xs font-semibold tracking-widest uppercase text-[#A3A3A3]\"\n      style=\"font-family: 'JetBrains Mono', monospace;\">\n      <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:radar-2-linear\" style=\"stroke-width: 1.5; font-size: 1.25rem; color: var(--accent);\"></iconify-icon>\n      <span>Exploration Terminal</span>\n    </div>\n\n    <div\n      class=\"text-xs font-semibold tracking-widest uppercase text-[#525866]\"\n      style=\"font-family: 'JetBrains Mono', monospace;\">\n      SYS.OP.VER // 4.0.2\n    </div>\n  </header>\n\n  <main class=\"relative z-10 min-h-screen w-full flex items-center pt-32 pb-24 lg:py-0 px-6 lg:px-24 max-w-[1800px] mx-auto\">\n\n    <div class=\"grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-12 gap-16 lg:gap-10 w-full items-center\">\n\n      <!-- Left Data & Typography Column -->\n      <div class=\"lg:col-span-7 flex flex-col items-start w-full\">\n\n        <!-- System Status Pill -->\n        <div class=\"mb-8 opacity-0\" id=\"fade-status\" style=\"transform: translateY(15px);\">\n          <div class=\"inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-3 py-1.5 rounded-[2px] border border-[var(--accent)]/25 bg-[var(--accent)]/7 backdrop-blur-sm\">\n            <div class=\"w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-[var(--accent)] shadow-[0_0_10px_var(--accent)] animate-pulse\"></div>\n            <span\n              class=\"text-xs font-semibold tracking-widest uppercase text-[var(--accent)]\"\n              style=\"font-family: 'JetBrains Mono', monospace;\">\n              Volumetric Lock Acquired\n            </span>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n\n        <!-- Primary Headline -->\n        <h1\n          id=\"reveal-text\"\n          class=\"text-5xl md:text-7xl lg:text-[112px] font-semibold text-[#F5F7FF] leading-[0.96] tracking-[-0.06em] max-w-4xl m-0 uppercase\">\n          Map the spatial void.\n        </h1>\n\n        <!-- Secondary Subtext -->\n        <p\n          class=\"mt-8 text-xl md:text-2xl text-[#A3AAB8] font-medium max-w-2xl opacity-0 leading-[1.45]\"\n          id=\"fade-subtext\"\n          style=\"transform: translateY(15px);\">\n          Synthesize dimensional environments with robotic precision. Real-time optical mapping meets high-frequency spatial intelligence.\n        </p>\n\n        <!-- Technical Readouts / Stats Grid -->\n        <div\n          class=\"mt-16 w-full max-w-xl grid grid-cols-2 md:grid-cols-3 gap-8 border-t border-white/5 pt-8 opacity-0\"\n          id=\"fade-stats\"\n          style=\"transform: translateY(15px);\">\n\n          <div class=\"flex flex-col gap-2\">\n            <span\n              class=\"text-xs font-semibold tracking-widest uppercase text-[#525866]\"\n              style=\"font-family: 'JetBrains Mono', monospace;\">\n              Render Core\n            </span>\n            <span class=\"text-4xl font-semibold tracking-[-0.04em] text-[#F5F7FF]\">\n              0.14<span class=\"text-lg text-[#A3AAB8]\">ms</span>\n            </span>\n          </div>\n\n          <div class=\"flex flex-col gap-2\">\n            <span\n              class=\"text-xs font-semibold tracking-widest uppercase text-[#525866]\"\n              style=\"font-family: 'JetBrains Mono', monospace;\">\n              Point Cloud\n            </span>\n            <span class=\"text-4xl font-semibold tracking-[-0.04em] text-[#F5F7FF]\">\n              14.2<span class=\"text-lg text-[#A3AAB8]\">m</span>\n            </span>\n          </div>\n\n          <div class=\"flex flex-col gap-2 hidden md:flex\">\n            <span\n              class=\"text-xs font-semibold tracking-widest uppercase text-[#525866]\"\n              style=\"font-family: 'JetBrains Mono', monospace;\">\n              Stability\n            </span>\n            <span class=\"text-4xl font-semibold tracking-[-0.04em] text-[var(--accent)]\">\n              99.9<span class=\"text-lg text-[var(--accent)]/60\">%</span>\n            </span>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n\n        <!-- Custom Terminal Interface Controls -->\n        <div\n          class=\"mt-16 flex flex-col gap-6 w-full max-w-sm opacity-0 pointer-events-auto\"\n          id=\"fade-controls\"\n          style=\"transform: translateY(15px);\">\n\n          <!-- Custom Toggle -->\n          <label class=\"flex items-center gap-4 cursor-pointer group w-max\">\n            <div\n              class=\"relative w-9 h-5 rounded-full bg-[#050505] border border-white/10 p-[1.5px] transition-colors duration-300 group-hover:border-[var(--accent)]/55\"\n              style=\"box-shadow: inset 0 2px 4px rgba(0,0,0,0.5);\">\n              <div class=\"absolute right-[2px] top-[2px] w-3.5 h-3.5 rounded-full bg-[var(--accent)] shadow-[0_0_12px_var(--accent)] transition-transform duration-300\"></div>\n            </div>\n\n            <span\n              class=\"text-xs font-semibold tracking-widest uppercase text-[#A3AAB8] group-hover:text-[#F5F7FF] transition-colors\"\n              style=\"font-family: 'JetBrains Mono', monospace;\">\n              Halftone Dither Pass\n            </span>\n          </label>\n\n          <!-- Custom Slider -->\n          <div class=\"flex items-center gap-5 w-full group\">\n            <span\n              class=\"text-xs font-semibold tracking-widest uppercase text-[#525866]\"\n              style=\"font-family: 'JetBrains Mono', monospace;\">\n              Freq\n            </span>\n\n            <div class=\"relative h-[2px] flex-1 bg-white/5 rounded-full overflow-visible\">\n              <div class=\"absolute left-0 top-0 bottom-0 w-[68%] bg-[var(--accent)]/35\"></div>\n              <div class=\"absolute left-0 top-0 bottom-0 w-[68%] bg-gradient-to-r from-transparent to-[var(--accent)] shadow-[0_0_14px_var(--accent)]\"></div>\n              <div class=\"absolute top-1/2 -translate-y-1/2 left-[68%] w-1.5 h-4 bg-[#F5F7FF] rounded-[1px] shadow-[0_0_8px_rgba(245,247,255,0.5)] cursor-ew-resize\"></div>\n            </div>\n\n            <span\n              class=\"text-xs font-semibold tracking-widest uppercase text-[var(--accent)]\"\n              style=\"font-family: 'JetBrains Mono', monospace;\">\n              0.68\n            </span>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n\n      <!-- Right Visual Column: Floating Overlay Cards -->\n      <div class=\"lg:col-span-5 hidden lg:flex justify-end items-center relative pointer-events-auto w-full min-h-[580px]\">\n\n        <div class=\"relative w-[430px] h-[560px] opacity-0\" id=\"fade-media\" style=\"transform: translateX(30px);\">\n\n          <!-- Rear Floating Card -->\n          <div\n            class=\"absolute top-10 right-2 w-[330px] h-[460px] rounded-[2px] opacity-80\"\n            style=\"\n              padding: 0.75px;\n              background: linear-gradient(to right bottom, rgba(129,140,248,0.55), rgba(14,165,233,0.16));\n              transform: rotate(2.5deg) translate3d(0,0,0);\n              box-shadow: 0 28px 90px rgba(0,0,0,0.45), 0 0 70px rgba(129,140,248,0.10);\n            \">\n\n            <div class=\"relative w-full h-full rounded-[1.25px] overflow-hidden p-1.5 bg-[#05070D]/95\">\n              <div class=\"relative w-full h-full bg-[#05070D] border border-white/5 overflow-hidden\">\n\n                <img\n                  src=\"https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1639322537504-6427a16b0a28?q=80&w=1000&auto=format&fit=crop\"\n                  class=\"absolute inset-0 w-full h-full object-cover opacity-42\"\n                  style=\"filter: grayscale(100%) contrast(1.25); mix-blend-mode: luminosity;\"\n                  alt=\"Robotic spatial structure\">\n\n                <div class=\"absolute inset-0 bg-[var(--violet)]/12 mix-blend-overlay\"></div>\n                <div class=\"absolute inset-0\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(to bottom, transparent 38%, #05070D 94%);\"></div>\n\n                <div class=\"absolute top-4 left-4 right-4 flex justify-between items-center\">\n                  <span\n                    class=\"text-[10px] font-semibold tracking-widest uppercase text-[var(--violet)]\"\n                    style=\"font-family: 'JetBrains Mono', monospace;\">\n                    Overlay B\n                  </span>\n\n                  <span\n                    class=\"text-[10px] font-semibold tracking-widest uppercase text-[#525866]\"\n                    style=\"font-family: 'JetBrains Mono', monospace;\">\n                    DRIFT +02.4\n                  </span>\n                </div>\n\n                <div class=\"absolute bottom-5 left-5 right-5\">\n                  <div class=\"flex justify-between text-[10px] font-semibold tracking-widest uppercase text-[#A3AAB8] mb-3\" style=\"font-family: 'JetBrains Mono', monospace;\">\n                    <span>Depth Map</span>\n                    <span class=\"text-[var(--violet)]\">72%</span>\n                  </div>\n\n                  <div class=\"w-full h-[1px] bg-white/10 relative\">\n                    <div class=\"absolute left-0 top-0 h-full bg-gradient-to-r from-[var(--violet)] to-transparent w-[72%]\"></div>\n                  </div>\n                </div>\n              </div>\n            </div>\n          </div>\n\n          <!-- Front Floating Card -->\n          <div\n            class=\"absolute top-0 left-0 w-[360px] xl:w-[400px] h-[520px] rounded-[2px]\"\n            style=\"\n              padding: 0.75px;\n              background: linear-gradient(to right bottom, rgba(56,189,248,0.7), rgba(7,89,133,0.18));\n              transform: rotate(-1.5deg) translate3d(0,0,0);\n              box-shadow: 0 34px 120px rgba(0,0,0,0.55), 0 0 90px rgba(56,189,248,0.12);\n            \">\n\n            <div class=\"relative w-full h-full rounded-[1.25px] overflow-hidden p-1.5\" style=\"background: rgba(5, 7, 13, 0.95);\">\n\n              <!-- Media Frame -->\n              <div class=\"relative w-full h-full bg-[#05070D] rounded-[1px] border border-white/5 overflow-hidden group\">\n\n                <!-- Mix-Blend Luminosity Image -->\n                <img\n                  src=\"https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1618005182384-a83a8bd57fbe?q=80&w=1000&auto=format&fit=crop\"\n                  class=\"absolute inset-0 w-full h-full object-cover opacity-50 transition-transform duration-1000 group-hover:scale-105 group-hover:opacity-62\"\n                  style=\"filter: grayscale(100%) contrast(1.28); mix-blend-mode: luminosity;\"\n                  alt=\"Topographic spatial structure\">\n\n                <!-- Electric Blue Tint Overlay -->\n                <div class=\"absolute inset-0 bg-[var(--accent)]/12 mix-blend-overlay\"></div>\n                <div class=\"absolute inset-0 bg-[radial-gradient(circle_at_70%_20%,rgba(56,189,248,0.22),transparent_32%)]\"></div>\n\n                <!-- Inner Shadow & Gradient Fade -->\n                <div class=\"absolute inset-0\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(to bottom, transparent 40%, #05070D 95%);\"></div>\n\n                <!-- Overlay UI Elements -->\n                <div class=\"absolute top-4 right-4 flex items-center gap-2 px-2 py-1 bg-[#05070D]/82 border border-white/10 rounded-[1px] backdrop-blur-md\">\n                  <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:maximize-square-minimalistic-linear\" style=\"font-size: 0.875rem; color: #A3AAB8;\"></iconify-icon>\n                </div>\n\n                <div class=\"absolute top-4 left-4 flex items-center gap-2 px-2 py-1 bg-[#05070D]/70 border border-[var(--accent)]/20 rounded-[1px] backdrop-blur-md\">\n                  <span class=\"w-1 h-1 bg-[var(--accent)] shadow-[0_0_8px_var(--accent)]\"></span>\n                  <span\n                    class=\"text-[10px] font-semibold tracking-widest uppercase text-[var(--accent)]\"\n                    style=\"font-family: 'JetBrains Mono', monospace;\">\n                    Live Scan\n                  </span>\n                </div>\n\n                <div class=\"absolute bottom-5 left-5 right-5 flex flex-col gap-4\">\n                  <div class=\"flex justify-between items-end\">\n                    <div class=\"flex flex-col gap-1\">\n                      <span\n                        class=\"text-[10px] font-semibold tracking-widest uppercase text-[#525866]\"\n                        style=\"font-family: 'JetBrains Mono', monospace;\">\n                        Target Sector\n                      </span>\n\n                      <span\n                        class=\"text-xs font-semibold tracking-widest uppercase text-[#F5F7FF]\"\n                        style=\"font-family: 'JetBrains Mono', monospace;\">\n                        Quadrant 4 Alpha\n                      </span>\n                    </div>\n\n                    <div class=\"flex items-center gap-1.5\">\n                      <div class=\"w-1 h-3 bg-[var(--accent)] animate-pulse\"></div>\n                      <div class=\"w-1 h-2 bg-[var(--accent)]/45\"></div>\n                      <div class=\"w-1 h-1 bg-[var(--accent)]/25\"></div>\n                    </div>\n                  </div>\n\n                  <div class=\"w-full h-[1px] bg-white/10 relative\">\n                    <div class=\"absolute left-0 top-0 h-full bg-gradient-to-r from-[var(--accent)] to-transparent w-[85%]\"></div>\n                  </div>\n\n                  <div\n                    class=\"flex justify-between text-[10px] font-semibold tracking-widest uppercase text-[#A3AAB8]\"\n                    style=\"font-family: 'JetBrains Mono', monospace;\">\n                    <span>Scan Depth</span>\n                    <span class=\"text-[var(--accent)]\">85%</span>\n                  </div>\n                </div>\n              </div>\n            </div>\n          </div>\n\n          <!-- Tiny Floating Diagnostic Chip -->\n          <div\n            class=\"absolute -bottom-2 right-12 px-3 py-2 bg-[#05070D]/80 border border-[var(--accent)]/20 backdrop-blur-xl shadow-[0_0_40px_rgba(56,189,248,0.08)]\"\n            style=\"transform: rotate(1.2deg);\">\n            <div class=\"flex items-center gap-2\">\n              <span class=\"w-1.5 h-1.5 bg-[var(--accent)] shadow-[0_0_10px_var(--accent)]\"></span>\n              <span\n                class=\"text-[10px] font-semibold tracking-widest uppercase text-[var(--accent-soft)]\"\n                style=\"font-family: 'JetBrains Mono', monospace;\">\n                Sector Stabilized\n              </span>\n            </div>\n          </div>\n\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </main>\n\n  <script>\n    // --- WebGL Background Integration ---\n    const vertexShader = `\n      void main() {\n        gl_Position = vec4(position, 1.0);\n      }\n    `;\n\n    const fragmentShader = `\n      precision highp float;\n      uniform vec2 u_resolution;\n      uniform float u_time;\n\n      float random(vec2 st) {\n        return fract(sin(dot(st.xy, vec2(12.9898,78.233))) * 43758.5453);\n      }\n\n      float noise(vec2 st) {\n        vec2 i = floor(st);\n        vec2 f = fract(st);\n\n        float a = random(i);\n        float b = random(i + vec2(1.0, 0.0));\n        float c = random(i + vec2(0.0, 1.0));\n        float d = random(i + vec2(1.0, 1.0));\n\n        vec2 u = f * f * (3.0 - 2.0 * f);\n\n        return mix(a, b, u.x) +\n          (c - a) * u.y * (1.0 - u.x) +\n          (d - b) * u.x * u.y;\n      }\n\n      float fbm(vec2 st) {\n        float v = 0.0;\n        float a = 0.5;\n        vec2 shift = vec2(100.0);\n        mat2 rot = mat2(cos(0.5), sin(0.5), -sin(0.5), cos(0.5));\n\n        for (int i = 0; i < 5; ++i) {\n          v += a * noise(st);\n          st = rot * st * 2.0 + shift;\n          a *= 0.5;\n        }\n\n        return v;\n      }\n\n      void main() {\n        vec2 uv = gl_FragCoord.xy / u_resolution.xy;\n        float aspect = u_resolution.x / u_resolution.y;\n\n        float beamCenter = 0.75;\n        float dist = uv.x - beamCenter;\n\n        float pulse = sin(u_time * 1.5) * 0.2 + 0.8;\n\n        float core = exp(-abs(dist) * 4500.0);\n        float glow = exp(-abs(dist) * 18.0) * pulse * 0.62;\n\n        vec2 smokeUv = uv * vec2(aspect, 1.0) * 4.0;\n        smokeUv.y -= u_time * 0.15;\n        smokeUv.x += sin(u_time * 0.2 + uv.y * 2.0) * 0.2;\n\n        float n = fbm(smokeUv);\n        float smoke = smoothstep(0.3, 0.7, n) * exp(-abs(dist) * 12.0) * pulse * 1.2;\n\n        float intensity = glow + smoke;\n\n        float ht = sin(gl_FragCoord.x * 2.5) * sin(gl_FragCoord.y * 2.5);\n        float halftone = step(ht * 0.5 + 0.5, intensity * 2.2);\n\n        vec3 baseColor = vec3(0.219, 0.741, 0.972); // Electric Blue #38BDF8\n        vec3 coreColor = vec3(0.92, 0.98, 1.0);\n\n        vec3 finalColor = mix(baseColor * halftone, coreColor, core);\n        float alpha = clamp(core + (halftone * intensity), 0.0, 1.0);\n\n        gl_FragColor = vec4(finalColor, alpha);\n      }\n    `;\n\n    document.addEventListener('DOMContentLoaded', () => {\n\n      // --- Init Three.js Shader System ---\n      const mount = document.getElementById('laser-mount');\n      if (!mount || !window.THREE) return;\n\n      const renderer = new THREE.WebGLRenderer({ alpha: true, antialias: false });\n      renderer.setClearColor(0x000000, 0);\n      mount.appendChild(renderer.domElement);\n\n      const scene = new THREE.Scene();\n      const camera = new THREE.OrthographicCamera(-1, 1, 1, -1, 0, 1);\n\n      const uniforms = {\n        u_time: { value: 0.0 },\n        u_resolution: { value: new THREE.Vector2() }\n      };\n\n      const material = new THREE.ShaderMaterial({\n        vertexShader,\n        fragmentShader,\n        uniforms,\n        transparent: true,\n        depthWrite: false\n      });\n\n      const geometry = new THREE.PlaneGeometry(2, 2);\n      const mesh = new THREE.Mesh(geometry, material);\n      scene.add(mesh);\n\n      const resize = () => {\n        const w = window.innerWidth;\n        const h = window.innerHeight;\n        const dpr = Math.min(window.devicePixelRatio, 2);\n\n        renderer.setSize(w, h);\n        renderer.setPixelRatio(dpr);\n        uniforms.u_resolution.value.set(w * dpr, h * dpr);\n      };\n\n      window.addEventListener('resize', resize);\n      resize();\n\n      const animate = (time) => {\n        uniforms.u_time.value = time * 0.001;\n        renderer.render(scene, camera);\n        requestAnimationFrame(animate);\n      };\n\n      requestAnimationFrame(animate);\n\n      // --- Interaction Parallax ---\n      const parallaxBg = document.getElementById('dot-parallax');\n\n      document.addEventListener('mousemove', (e) => {\n        const x = (e.clientX / window.innerWidth - 0.5) * 30;\n        const y = (e.clientY / window.innerHeight - 0.5) * 30;\n\n        if (parallaxBg) {\n          parallaxBg.style.transform = `translate(${x}px, ${y}px)`;\n        }\n      });\n\n      // --- GSAP Masked Reveal Implementation ---\n      gsap.registerPlugin(ScrollTrigger);\n\n      const titleEl = document.getElementById('reveal-text');\n\n      if (titleEl) {\n        const words = titleEl.innerText.trim().split(/\\s+/);\n        titleEl.innerHTML = '';\n\n        words.forEach((word) => {\n          const maskSpan = document.createElement('span');\n          maskSpan.style.cssText = 'overflow: hidden; display: inline-block; vertical-align: top; padding-right: 0.2em; padding-bottom: 0.1em; margin-bottom: -0.1em;';\n\n          const innerSpan = document.createElement('span');\n          innerSpan.style.cssText = 'display: inline-block; transform: translateY(110%); transform-origin: top left;';\n          innerSpan.innerText = word;\n          innerSpan.className = 'reveal-word';\n\n          maskSpan.appendChild(innerSpan);\n          titleEl.appendChild(maskSpan);\n        });\n      }\n\n      const tl = gsap.timeline({ delay: 0.2 });\n\n      tl.to('#fade-status', {\n        opacity: 1,\n        y: 0,\n        duration: 0.8,\n        ease: \"power2.out\"\n      })\n      .to('.reveal-word', {\n        y: \"0%\",\n        duration: 1.4,\n        ease: \"power4.out\",\n        stagger: 0.08\n      }, \"-=0.4\")\n      .to('#fade-subtext', {\n        opacity: 1,\n        y: 0,\n        duration: 1,\n        ease: \"power3.out\"\n      }, \"-=1.0\")\n      .to('#fade-stats', {\n        opacity: 1,\n        y: 0,\n        duration: 1,\n        ease: \"power3.out\"\n      }, \"-=0.8\")\n      .to('#fade-controls', {\n        opacity: 1,\n        y: 0,\n        duration: 1,\n        ease: \"power3.out\"\n      }, \"-=0.8\")\n      .to('#fade-media', {\n        opacity: 1,\n        x: 0,\n        duration: 1.5,\n        ease: \"power4.out\"\n      }, \"-=1.2\");\n    });\n  </script>\n</body>\n</html>", "preview_file_name": "spatial-exploring-terminal.html", "thumbnail_url": "https://hoirqrkdgbmvpwutwuwj.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/design-system-thumbnails/staff-featured-2026-05-22/spatial-exploring-terminal.jpg", "source_name": "spatial-exploring-terminal-DESIGN.md", "views": 183, "forks": 5, "private": false, "featured": true, "created_by": "66a84ecf-0972-40f3-8a4c-15b11d3aee0a", "created_at": "2026-05-22T07:58:12.433844+00:00", "updated_at": "2026-07-03T23:43:06.540223+00:00"}